{"schema_version":3,"seq":40,"timestamp_ms":1794950315951,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened five follow-up tickets, one for each affected component. I commented on the incident ticket #323 and set it to `resolved`. I didn't re-read the tickets afterwards to check the saved state. `/app/STATUS.json` is written with status `success`.\n\nThe teams come from the open ownership ticket #325. I ignored the closed 2025 table (#324), which is superseded and lists `session-store` under `platform` instead of `identity`.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | `payments-api` | `billing` |\n| #327 | `edge-proxy` | `platform` |\n| #328 | `session-store` | `identity` |\n| #329 | `events-pipeline` | `data` |\n| #330 | `notify-service` | `platform` |\n\nEach ticket is `P2` with the `followup` label. I searched for existing `Follow-up INC-2291` tickets first and found none. I didn't change any other ticket.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
